{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>去女僕cafe，不單只有少女跟你施魔法？日本群馬縣有一間高齡女僕cafe，65歲以上才有資格當女僕！這間女僕店叫「冥土喫茶しゃんぐりら」，巧妙運用日文「女僕（Maid）」與「冥土」的諧音，融入黑色幽默。由7位年齡介乎 65 至 72 歲的銀髮老太太坐鎮，她們身穿經典黑白女僕裝，上菜時不僅熱情比心手勢，還會親切唸出魔法咒語～女僕店由非牟利組織籌辦，提供長者社交聚腳點，讓長者們融入社會。長者店員笑言與客人互動讓自己「心境變年輕」！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17914752395577618_1170994406ac7be28039c8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179147524142653347_9126610836ac7be2a33b24.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17914752444309335_19223303026ac7be2dbae32.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179147524791892984_13180317646ac7be30aa24b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T16:18:10.593276+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":282,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}